        "text": "**What is confirmed:** *Wired* published an investigative report on November 19, 2026, based on leaked internal documents detailing how Polish-based right-wing X account **Visegrad24** built high reach, gained frequent amplification from Elon Musk, and raised Silicon Valley funding through anti-migrant and pro-Israel content campaigns"
