    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 4827,
        "endIndex": 5066,
        "text": "**What is confirmed:** The UK’s Investigatory Powers Tribunal ruled against the UK Home Office, rejecting its attempt to keep secret a \"technical capability notice\" (TCN) served on Apple to compel backdoor access to encrypted iCloud data"
